tml>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#ff0099;\"><em>I said \"yes\" again to the love of my life at Grand Coral Beach Club, Playa del Carmen, Mexico on our 4th anniversary - October 20, 2015<\/em><\/span>","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283437399,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.222.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79783,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3377a03ddde93f043d2651d4e2a05fc","RawContent":"[quote name=\"acw271011\" post=\"1908176\" timestamp=\"1449516701\"]\n@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] Your memory is incredible! I completely forgot about Elsa&#039;s wedding! lol[\/quote]Sometimes I impress myself lol\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1908178,"PostDate":1449495670,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>acw271011, on 07 December 2015 - 01:31 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> Your memory is incredible! I completely forgot about Elsa's wedding! lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nSometimes I impress myself lol<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399407002,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.212.27.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79783,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"706c913f33ecded0f6452329a237d125","RawContent":"Aw yay. Its definitely  cool seeing some others brides ideas \n\n So far im leaning twards options like these (picture)\n\n\nBut with smaller centerpieces  and a sequin table runner. My mother in law is using silk and we are possibly shipping some there. If not well check them when we fly. \n\n\nPossibly a rectangle shaped vase or box with hydrangeas with little pops of light pink.","Attachments":[{"Id":34429,"Name":"15Lindsay-Ellingson-Rose-Gold-Wedding-South-Carolina-Perry-Vaile-centerpieces.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285524-0-46645900-1449518010.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2015\/post-285524-0-46645900-1449518010_thumb.jpg","Width":630,"Height":420}],"Id":1908181,"PostDate":1449496700,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Aw yay. Its definitely  cool seeing some others brides ideas <br>\n So far im leaning twards options like these (picture)<br><br>\nBut with smaller centerpieces  and a sequin table runner. My mother in law is using silk and we are possibly shipping some there. If not well check them when we fly. <br><br>\nPossibly a rectangle shaped vase or box with hydrangeas with little pops of light pink.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"incubus42088@gmail.com","IpAddress":"73.212.27.87","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449257284,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Incubus42088","Id":285524,"Name":"Incubus42088","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79783,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce10b30411785733700182099c7b2dc9","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"margin:0cm;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Hi there! Congratulations on your engagement!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;In our experience as a beach venue, the welcome table is very popular! Our brides really like to incorporate personal elements.&amp;nbsp;emotional, funny or functional in some case just to remind everyone that they were part of the big day!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;Take a look!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\"&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:albums:18129]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;About the colors; blue and pink are great option for a beach wedding,&amp;nbsp;it fresh chic and TRENDY!&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;here you got some pictures about our decoratons with these colors :)&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81801]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81803]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:82068]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:81805]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&#039;&gt;http:\/\/bit.ly\/PlanYourWedding&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;Have a great planning!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908253,"PostDate":1449659405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"margin:0cm\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">Hi there! Congratulations on your engagement!\u00a0<\/span><\/p><p><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">In our experience as a beach venue, the welcome table is very popular! Our brides really like to incorporate personal elements.\u00a0emotional, funny or functional in some case just to remind everyone that they were part of the big day!<\/span><\/p><p><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\">Take a look!!<\/span><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:Arial, sans-serif\"><\/span><\/p><p><\/p>\n<p  style=\"margin:0cm 0cm .0001pt\">\u00a0<\/p>\n<div><div class='_sharedMediaBbcode'>\n\t<div class='bbcode_mediaWrap clearfix'>\n\t\t<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18129-welcome-table\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18129\/tn_gallery_258213_18129_2881023.jpg' class='sharedmedia_screenshot cover_img_75' title='A&S 6.6.15 54'  width='75' height='75'  alt='A&S 6.6.15 54' id='tn_image_view_82460_cover' \/><\/a>\n\t\t<div class='details'>\n\t\t\t<h5><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/album\/18129-welcome-table\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Album: Welcome table<\/a><\/h5>\n\t\t\t<div>9 images<\/div>\n\t\t\t<div>0 comments<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>About the colors; blue and pink are great option for a beach wedding,\u00a0it fresh chic and TRENDY!<\/div>\n<div>here you got some pictures about our decoratons with these colors <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81801-white-pink-and-rustic-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_4291773.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='White, pink and rustic ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='White, pink and rustic ceremony' id='sml_image_view_81801' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/81803-beach-wedding-decoration\/' c