{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e9d3e6ff526eedb8f4b703b42fe2669","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi everyone.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ve asked my wedding coordinator but I haven&#039;t received a straight answer.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I&#039;m at the resort.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1560351,"PostDate":1325026571,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi everyone.\u00a0 I'm getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.\u00a0 Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?\u00a0 I've asked my wedding coordinator but I haven't received a straight answer.\u00a0 I'm not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I'm at the resort.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anderson_laura1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305927214,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240223.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jtalaura1","Id":240223,"Name":"jtalaura1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86cb44956125ecc443fba4c3f66c677b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We&#039;re getting married on the 5th of May and I have yet to make those decisions as well.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1560656,"PostDate":1325097762,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We're getting married on the 5th of May and I have yet to make those decisions as well.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megansmall@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320721963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247473.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megansmall","Id":247473,"Name":"megansmall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d3005f87b1fc6474c35dc2a71ed4383","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MittensDW[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello, \n Im in the process of planning a wedding at dreams but dont know where to start... \n I am getting in touch with a travel agent to see what rates we can get for flights and hotel. Is this the best way to go? \n Also, I have emailed Dreams to get information about pricing\/packages offered etc, but no one is getting back to me. Is there someone in particular i should call or email. \n Please let me know.[\/quote] \n Hi Mittens, \n \n for a TA, you can contactus at: [url=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\"]http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/[\/url] \n \n i am a dreams specialist and got married there.  I also know the wedding department, management etc and we do an annual site visit.","Attachments":[],"Id":1560688,"PostDate":1325101111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MittensDW<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello,<\/p> <p> Im in the process of planning a wedding at dreams but dont know where to start...<\/p> <p> I am getting in touch with a travel agent to see what rates we can get for flights and hotel. Is this the best way to go?<\/p> <p> Also, I have emailed Dreams to get information about pricing\/packages offered etc, but no one is getting back to me. Is there someone in particular i should call or email.<\/p> <p> Please let me know.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Hi Mittens,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> for a TA, you can contactus at:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.wrighttra...\/leads\/inquiry\/<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i am a dreams specialist and got married there. \u00a0I also know the wedding department, management etc and we do an annual site visit.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"076555320d9ab165f6f99032b2e5dc72","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jtalaura1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone.  I&#039;m getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.  Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?  I&#039;ve asked my wedding coordinator but I haven&#039;t received a straight answer.  I&#039;m not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I&#039;m at the resort.  Thanks![\/quote] \n \n \n may 27th is when i got married at dreams los cabos.  usually you will not decide the flowers, decor until a month out.  if you have a specific idea of what you want, you can send images to your coordinator and see if she can get quotes for you.","Attachments":[],"Id":1560689,"PostDate":1325101208,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jtalaura1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone.\u00a0 I'm getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.\u00a0 Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?\u00a0 I've asked my wedding coordinator but I haven't received a straight answer.\u00a0 I'm not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I'm at the resort.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> may 27th is when i got married at dreams los cabos. \u00a0usually you will not decide the flowers, decor until a month out. \u00a0if you have a specific idea of what you want, you can send images to your coordinator and see if she can get quotes for you.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ab7d7bafd922e5bd97f5d1319d1b810","RawContent":"Oh Goodness you will be there when I am!  I am getting married May 25, 2012! [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jtalaura1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi everyone.  I&#039;m getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.  Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?  I&#039;ve asked my wedding coordinator but I haven&#039;t received a straight answer.  I&#039;m not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I&#039;m at the resort.  Thanks![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1567183,"PostDate":1326333114,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Oh Goodness you will be there when I am!\u00a0 I am getting married May 25, 2012!<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jtalaura1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi everyone.\u00a0 I'm getting married at Dreams on May 27, 2012.\u00a0 Does anyone know when I select flowers, decorations (chair bows, linens, etc), wedding arch, etc?\u00a0 I've asked my wedding coordinator but I haven't received a straight answer.\u00a0 I'm not sure if I should be picking these things out now or if I select them a few days before then wedding when I'm at the resort.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"61840f0750b36462c4784cf2b6823338","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m getting married May 5th and am wondering the same things. How do we choose the colors??&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1567432,"PostDate":1326395757,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm getting married May 5th and am wondering the same things. How do we choose the colors??<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megansmall@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320721963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247473.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megansmall","Id":247473,"Name":"megansmall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7b2795270438526860b007bc5bda4df","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Have so much fun this weekend!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1567434,"PostDate":1326395830,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Have so much fun this weekend!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"megansmall@mac.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1320721963,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247473.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"megansmall","Id":247473,"Name":"megansmall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4cf6fc8b12b4dcd7b33970774bde9860","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I went in for a site visit so I sat down and chose the colors with Magda but you can just ask her if they have the colors that you want.&amp;nbsp; She told me that they could find any color.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570652,"PostDate":1327033443,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I went in for a site visit so I sat down and chose the colors with Magda but you can just ask her if they have the colors that you want.\u00a0 She told me that they could find any color.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0242787951976a02f9b362be2b645cd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i just noticed in the price guide under decorations it says prices are per hour? so if i rent napkins they are gonna charge $2-$4 an hour???? did anyone rent napkins or tablecloths? if so do they actually charge per hour for them?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571645,"PostDate":1327272614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i just noticed in the price guide under decorations it says prices are per hour? so if i rent napkins they are gonna charge $2-$4 an hour???? did anyone rent napkins or tablecloths? if so do they actually charge per hour for them?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angeleyez0007@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327093735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250247.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashleyrm","Id":250247,"Name":"ashleyrm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c8d1770410d31ca3c65b31ef8a454485","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi. I am getting married at Dreams in June2012. I agree that Magda is not always on the ball about responding. But I have been able to do a lot on my own through a lot of research and hard work. Hopefully this will save other brides time and frustration.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Vendors we are using are as follows:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ceremony and Cocktail Music- Spanish guitarist Arturo Santomayo. He is at least&amp;nbsp;$200 cheaper to book on your own and not through Dreams. He has a website and you can hear his music on there. Couldn&#039;t be a nicer guy on the planet to deal with.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Flowers: Lola with Florenta. If you are picky about flowers- she can help you. Already we have emailed hundreds of times. She seems to be great.Go to Florenta Los Cabos on facebook to see her work.&amp;nbsp;She is expensive. I paid $1900 for 4 huge centerpieces and ceremony decorations, bridal party flowers and a bag of roses. Crazy! But flowers are important to me.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Cake- Sweet Dreams Los Cabos. I am using the cake in the package for the rehearsal dinner because I wanted a three tier cake. I hear that Sweet Dreams is awesome. Response time is slow however so be prepared. Also a facebook page.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Decorations: Oxten- Hector Portugal- I got a dance floor, and fancy uplighting and dance floor lighting from Hector for the same price I would have gotten a dance floor and lanterns only from Dreams.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; DJ Ricardo- Saved about $200 by booking on my own.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; All in all, I didn&#039;t want to wait for the last minute for Magda to work with me on this stuff. So I booked these people on&amp;nbsp; my own, and ok&#039;d it with Magda via email. Be prepared to wire deposits in advance when booking on your own. But I saved about $500 doing this and feel I found the best group of people to make my wedding great.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572330,"PostDate":1327412616,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi. I am getting married at Dreams in June2012. I agree that Magda is not always on the ball about responding. But I have been able to do a lot on my own through a lot of research and hard work. Hopefully this will save other brides time and frustration.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Vendors we are using are as follows:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ceremony and Cocktail Music- Spanish guitarist Arturo Santomayo. He is at least\u00a0$200 cheaper to book on your own and not through Dreams. He has a website and you can hear his music on there. Couldn't be a nicer guy on the planet to deal with.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Flowers: Lola with Florenta. If you are picky about flowers- she can help you. Already we have emailed hundreds of times. She seems to be great.Go to Florenta Los Cabos on facebook to see her work.\u00a0She is expensive. I paid $1900 for 4 huge centerpieces and ceremony decorations, bridal party flowers and a bag of roses. Crazy! But flowers are important to me.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Cake- Sweet Dreams Los Cabos. I am using the cake in the package for the rehearsal dinner because I wanted a three tier cake. I hear that Sweet Dreams is awesome. Response time is slow however so be prepared. Also a facebook page.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Decorations: Oxten- Hector Portugal- I got a dance floor, and fancy uplighting and dance floor lighting from Hector for the same price I would have gotten a dance floor and lanterns only from Dreams.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> DJ Ricardo- Saved about $200 by booking on my own.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> All in all, I didn't want to wait for the last minute for Magda to work with me on this stuff. So I booked these people on\u00a0 my own, and ok'd it with Magda via email. Be prepared to wire deposits in advance when booking on your own. But I saved about $500 doing this and feel I found the best group of people to make my wedding great.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandawebster1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323437472,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248485.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandawebster1","Id":248485,"Name":"amandawebster1","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
