{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ebb608370bfbfc3af94ad4d9f15e174","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great Job Amanda!! DJ Ricardo is the BOMB!! He is super professional and a true pleasure to work with!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572773,"PostDate":1327462416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great Job Amanda!! DJ Ricardo is the BOMB!! He is super professional and a true pleasure to work with!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"erika.holler@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.177.241.195","GroupId":46,"GroupName":"VIP Member","JoinDate":1224480180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-212330.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":79,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Erika J","Id":212330,"Name":"Erika J","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9983dc0d5950abb024a6ecb96d7daaf6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Florenta is high.&amp;nbsp; Dreams just started added a new flower vendor called Emporium.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572786,"PostDate":1327464285,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Florenta is high.\u00a0 Dreams just started added a new flower vendor called Emporium.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f08554ae14ecaf27a146e6175d8f468c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; The correct name: &lt;span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&amp;quot;Century Gothic&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;sans-serif&amp;quot;\"&gt;Emporio Arte Flora&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1572790,"PostDate":1327464544,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> The correct name: <span  style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot\">Emporio Arte Flora<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c865cf6bafeb2f1315e894a26a9d1a8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I looked into using that vendor. The owner was quite slow to respond to me and when I sent&amp;nbsp;a photo of the flowers I was looking for he was not able to duplicate them.&amp;nbsp;photo he sent back was missing&amp;nbsp;some of the flowers and looked nothing like my photo.&amp;nbsp;I think he does more classic flowers and I am looking for modern. It&#039;s true that florist is about half the cost of Florenta and may be a better choice for some.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573436,"PostDate":1327553549,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I looked into using that vendor. The owner was quite slow to respond to me and when I sent\u00a0a photo of the flowers I was looking for he was not able to duplicate them.\u00a0photo he sent back was missing\u00a0some of the flowers and looked nothing like my photo.\u00a0I think he does more classic flowers and I am looking for modern. It's true that florist is about half the cost of Florenta and may be a better choice for some.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandawebster1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323437472,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248485.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandawebster1","Id":248485,"Name":"amandawebster1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e008fd925535bca043998c6ac3e5e42e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That&#039;s interesting about the slow response, Alina always responded to me quickly.&amp;nbsp; And I am only using calla lilies so I guess I was sort of simple.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573439,"PostDate":1327553775,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That's interesting about the slow response, Alina always responded to me quickly.\u00a0 And I am only using calla lilies so I guess I was sort of simple.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b60ad6913f431c1dff8ab05a1f5d9e6e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; To Dreams Los Cabos brides -&amp;nbsp;Wondering if anyone has any advice -&amp;nbsp;It looks like WAY more people are RSVP&#039;ing yes than we expected to our November 2012 wedding. We had thought we&#039;d have 35 - 40 and it looks like we may have over 60 *(which&amp;nbsp;will likely be a&amp;nbsp;huge strain on our budget and I&#039;m a bit stressed about that). Does anyone know how Dreams Cabo charges for the wedding and how much per head I can expect? When we started this, I was picturing a smallish but super fun wedding. Apparently people are loving the location so everyone is getting on board. Lovely but Yikes!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588942,"PostDate":1330622814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> To Dreams Los Cabos brides -\u00a0Wondering if anyone has any advice -\u00a0It looks like WAY more people are RSVP'ing yes than we expected to our November 2012 wedding. We had thought we'd have 35 - 40 and it looks like we may have over 60 *(which\u00a0will likely be a\u00a0huge strain on our budget and I'm a bit stressed about that). Does anyone know how Dreams Cabo charges for the wedding and how much per head I can expect? When we started this, I was picturing a smallish but super fun wedding. Apparently people are loving the location so everyone is getting on board. Lovely but Yikes!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbecker@bclc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319736074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247145.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McLecker","Id":247145,"Name":"McLecker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"72f26cc30931aee3a4e4aa27d0bf6ef6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have the same situation going on. We expected no more than 25 people to come and we are up to 40! From what I see in our wedding package information, up to 20 guests are part of the package, beyond that each person can be an additional $62-75. I&#039;m kinda hoping we can work something out for a better deal since that&#039;s pretty much two weddings worth of people according to the packages they offer. The worst part is some of our guests have a timeshare at a nearby hotel and they have opted not to stay at our hotel and their entrance fee to the hotel\/wedding is $95!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m with ya on worrying about budget. I had no idea so many people would be this excited to travel to another country! But I&#039;m happy they can come and I&#039;m sure everything will work out in the end.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588955,"PostDate":1330623774,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have the same situation going on. We expected no more than 25 people to come and we are up to 40! From what I see in our wedding package information, up to 20 guests are part of the package, beyond that each person can be an additional $62-75. I'm kinda hoping we can work something out for a better deal since that's pretty much two weddings worth of people according to the packages they offer. The worst part is some of our guests have a timeshare at a nearby hotel and they have opted not to stay at our hotel and their entrance fee to the hotel\/wedding is $95!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm with ya on worrying about budget. I had no idea so many people would be this excited to travel to another country! But I'm happy they can come and I'm sure everything will work out in the end.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"casandrakc@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1318617098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246710.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":280,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Casi","Id":246710,"Name":"Casi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"01234a4a2dd4ecc43cb3f26d65951d70","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hello Dreams Los Cabos brides,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We just scheduled a webinar with Magda at Dreams Los Cabos.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; You can get more information here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78433\/bdw-wedding-webinar-dreams-los-cabos-zoetry-casa-del-mar-april-21-9-00am-pst\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dreams Los Cabos Wedding Webinar&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt;Magda Rueda, Dreams Los Cabos &amp;amp; Zoetry Casa del Mar, Wedding Coordinator, will be a panelist and will give a presentation as well as be on hand for a Q &amp;amp; A session.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;This is a great opportunity for current&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;Dreams Los Cabos or Zoetry Casa del Mar&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;&amp;nbsp;brides and grooms or those considering the venues for the wedding location to get your questions answered.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;div style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;All that attend the webinar and get married at Dreams Los Cabos or Zoetry Casa del Mar will receive:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/div&gt; &lt;ul style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;1 upgrade for the bride and groom.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128); \"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size: 14px; \"&gt;Free gift upon arrival (champagne &amp;amp; fruit plate)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/li&gt; &lt;\/ul&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588960,"PostDate":1330624060,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hello Dreams Los Cabos brides,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just scheduled a webinar with Magda at Dreams Los Cabos.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You can get more information here: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/78433\/bdw-wedding-webinar-dreams-los-cabos-zoetry-casa-del-mar-april-21-9-00am-pst' class='bbc_url' title=''><strong>Dreams Los Cabos Wedding Webinar<\/strong><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\">Magda Rueda, Dreams Los Cabos & Zoetry Casa del Mar, Wedding Coordinator, will be a panelist and will give a presentation as well as be on hand for a Q & A session.<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> <span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">This is a great opportunity for current\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Dreams Los Cabos or Zoetry Casa del Mar<\/span><span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">\u00a0brides and grooms or those considering the venues for the wedding location to get your questions answered.\u00a0<\/span><\/div> <div  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/div> <div  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> <strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"><span  style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128)\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">All that attend the webinar and get married at Dreams Los Cabos or Zoetry Casa del Mar will receive:<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/div> <ul style=\"list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"> <li> <strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"><span  style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128)\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">1 upgrade for the bride and groom.<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li> <li> <strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"><span  style=\"color: rgb(128, 0, 128)\"><span  style=\"font-size: 14px\">Free gift upon arrival (champagne & fruit plate)<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/li> <\/ul>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e041d9d5738255bf60fa25f309f18edf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Casi for your feedback!&amp;nbsp;Are you serious-&amp;nbsp;$95 per person who isn&#039;t staying on the resort? We have a bunch doing that also! Is that $95 + the $75 or whatever that you pay for the dinner? Are you covering the $95 cost of them entering the venue? Wow - I&#039;m not sure how to handle that one. How has anyone else addressed that? Do you make the guests pay that part? And the $62-$75 - does that include linens etc? or is it just the dinner\/cocktail?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588974,"PostDate":1330624839,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Casi for your feedback!\u00a0Are you serious-\u00a0$95 per person who isn't staying on the resort? We have a bunch doing that also! Is that $95 + the $75 or whatever that you pay for the dinner? Are you covering the $95 cost of them entering the venue? Wow - I'm not sure how to handle that one. How has anyone else addressed that? Do you make the guests pay that part? And the $62-$75 - does that include linens etc? or is it just the dinner\/cocktail?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mbecker@bclc.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319736074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247145.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"McLecker","Id":247145,"Name":"McLecker","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":64254,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0cd4d460b2f759a75d5d4bf618fe1ad8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yes. $95 per person staying off resort. I have to say that I am finding that Dreams doesn&#039;t work with you at all or make ANY exceptions on these items.&amp;nbsp;I have&amp;nbsp;been pretty upset by the way&amp;nbsp;I am treated- like just another number to&amp;nbsp;them.&amp;nbsp;Little care or concern is shown during planning.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our package included a 1 hour music trio and come to find out if we don&#039;t want to use the trio-because we wanted a spanish guitarist we pick- they won&#039;t credit us the $350 for anything else- even though we are spending a lot of money on extra people&amp;nbsp;and have about 35 guests&amp;nbsp;staying at the resort as well as spending our entire honeymoon there. I guess that means nothing. Then you have to also use the in house photographer or guess what- again no credit from package!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Same thing with the cake. We wanted a professional cake- and if we&amp;nbsp;since we aren&#039;t&amp;nbsp;using the cake in the package- it&#039;s our loss- no credit or we have to use it at another event. So we spent money on the ultimate wedding package and&amp;nbsp;at leat $500&amp;nbsp;has gone down the drain. We have to have an extra cake we don&#039;t even want. Too bad for us.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It&#039;s really sad. Nobody there seems to care. I am concerned about how this is going to turn out and how&amp;nbsp;we and our&amp;nbsp;guests will be treated when we get there. When I express concern or ask to escalate any issue- I get no response.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck to everyone. It hasn&#039;t been a fun experience and much more stress than I ever anticipated.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1591378,"PostDate":1331093755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yes. $95 per person staying off resort. I have to say that I am finding that Dreams doesn't work with you at all or make ANY exceptions on these items.\u00a0I have\u00a0been pretty upset by the way\u00a0I am treated- like just another number to\u00a0them.\u00a0Little care or concern is shown during planning.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our package included a 1 hour music trio and come to find out if we don't want to use the trio-because we wanted a spanish guitarist we pick- they won't credit us the $350 for anything else- even though we are spending a lot of money on extra people\u00a0and have about 35 guests\u00a0staying at the resort as well as spending our entire honeymoon there. I guess that means nothing. Then you have to also use the in house photographer or guess what- again no credit from package!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Same thing with the cake. We wanted a professional cake- and if we\u00a0since we aren't\u00a0using the cake in the package- it's our loss- no credit or we have to use it at another event. So we spent money on the ultimate wedding package and\u00a0at leat $500\u00a0has gone down the drain. We have to have an extra cake we don't even want. Too bad for us.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's really sad. Nobody there seems to care. I am concerned about how this is going to turn out and how\u00a0we and our\u00a0guests will be treated when we get there. When I express concern or ask to escalate any issue- I get no response.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck to everyone. It hasn't been a fun experience and much more stress than I ever anticipated.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"amandawebster1@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323437472,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248485.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"amandawebster1","Id":248485,"Name":"amandawebster1","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":69,"TotalPages":7,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":60},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
