50 guests, but we have a long list of invites!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Need help with&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Decorations for tables, especailly candles. Do you bring these with you?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Flower recommendations&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Has anyone ever gotten the \"lights under the table\" feature at Dreams?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Booked my reception at the Casade Terrace since my FI wanted the beach backdrop, I know this isn&#039;t as private as the Oceana, but is it really a nuisance with people gawking?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1758874,"PostDate":1368821655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Ladies any help is much appreciated!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are hoping to only have 50 guests, but we have a long list of invites!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Need help with<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Decorations for tables, especailly candles. Do you bring these with you?<\/p> <p> -Flower recommendations<\/p> <p> -Has anyone ever gotten the \"lights under the table\" feature at Dreams?<\/p> <p> -Booked my reception at the Casade Terrace since my FI wanted the beach backdrop, I know this isn't as private as the Oceana, but is it really a nuisance with people gawking?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marisol.salguero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"161.149.63.168","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1362945137,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-267159.jpg?_r=1404881843","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"SCchickie","Id":267159,"Name":"SCchickie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":73968,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05c8b8685890b11a16dd07bf001d7f67","RawContent":"Hi  SCchickie! Congrats on booking your wedding! I booked mine for Oct 2014. I&#039;ve been in contact with Yesica and I just e-mailed her inquiring about vendors for flowers, d\u00a9cor and etc. I also was looking into the lights under the table because we too booked our reception at Cascade Terrace. Once I get a list of recommendations for everything I can forward you the info to you so you can get a rough idea. \n \n Again, Congrats! \n \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]SCchickie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Ladies any help is much appreciated!!! \n \n We are hoping to only have 50 guests, but we have a long list of invites! \n \n Need help with \n \n -Decorations for tables, especailly candles. Do you bring these with you? \n -Flower recommendations \n -Has anyone ever gotten the \"lights under the table\" feature at Dreams? \n -Booked my reception at the Casade Terrace since my FI wanted the beach backdrop, I know this isn&#039;t as private as the Oceana, but is it really a nuisance with people gawking?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1760690,"PostDate":1369348994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi\u00a0 SCchickie! Congrats on booking your wedding! I booked mine for Oct 2014. I've been in contact with Yesica and I just e-mailed her inquiring about vendors for flowers, d\u00a9cor and etc. I also was looking into the lights under the table because we too booked our reception at Cascade Terrace. Once I get a list of recommendations for everything I can forward you\u00a0the info to you so you can get a rough idea.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Again, Congrats!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>SCchickie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Ladies any help is much appreciated!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are hoping to only have 50 guests, but we have a long list of invites!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Need help with<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Decorations for tables, especailly candles. Do you bring these with you?<\/p> <p> -Flower recommendations<\/p> <p> -Has anyone ever gotten the \"lights under the table\" feature at Dreams?<\/p> <p> -Booked my reception at the Casade Terrace since my FI wanted the beach backdrop, I know this isn't as private as the Oceana, but is it really a nuisance with people gawking?<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jo_hannam@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"50.240.208.1","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1360195258,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-265753.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"J0hanna","Id":265753,"Name":"J0hanna","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"73968","Title":"Just booked my wedding fro Dreams Los Cabos for May 31, 2014!","LastPostDate":1369348994},"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
