{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":3,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":false,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":2379,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1570971,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":250247,"Name":"ashleyrm","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250247.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1327093986,"LastPoster":{"Id":232862,"Name":"bride3183","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232862.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":118,"Preview":{"Id":1606638,"PostDate":1334201256,"PostContent":"Hi Ashley,  We had the ultimate package with the surf and turf with 33 guests. \u00a0We paid an...","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Dreams Los Cabos - October 29, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"janelle.hshman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286063473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232862.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bride3183","Id":232862,"Name":"bride3183","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65409,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"707ca022c5369532f8595c285ab5d585","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; im looking into getting married at dreams los cabos, i would like some help figuring out how much it is going to cost me.. if anyone could help that would be great, we have about 50 guests all staying at the resort, id like to do the ultimate package that is $2999 but it says there is an additional charge for more than 20 people? and does anyone know how much that cost actually is and what do they set up for beach wedding and reception for that $2999? is it just plain chairs and plain tables? any help would be much appreciated!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570971,"PostDate":1327093986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hi,<\/p> <p> im looking into getting married at dreams los cabos, i would like some help figuring out how much it is going to cost me.. if anyone could help that would be great, we have about 50 guests all staying at the resort, id like to do the ultimate package that is $2999 but it says there is an additional charge for more than 20 people? and does anyone know how much that cost actually is and what do they set up for beach wedding and reception for that $2999? is it just plain chairs and plain tables? any help would be much appreciated!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"angeleyez0007@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327093735,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250247.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashleyrm","Id":250247,"Name":"ashleyrm","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65409,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6a70290487f5a78ab1129ba19cd5110","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It depends on which menu you pick...I don&#039;t know if\/when the prices will change but I am ordering from the silver menu so my cost is 65.00\/pp.&amp;nbsp; I actually sat down and did the math and since I am not using their photographer, their stylist or the trio, it was cheaper for me to just get the complimentary package and pay per person for the meals.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, plain white ties, napkins, etc. are included but you can change the colors if you want.&amp;nbsp; The price for napkins were 2.00 each and ties are 3.00 each...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1571046,"PostDate":1327103339,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It depends on which menu you pick...I don't know if\/when the prices will change but I am ordering from the silver menu so my cost is 65.00\/pp.\u00a0 I actually sat down and did the math and since I am not using their photographer, their stylist or the trio, it was cheaper for me to just get the complimentary package and pay per person for the meals.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, plain white ties, napkins, etc. are included but you can change the colors if you want.\u00a0 The price for napkins were 2.00 each and ties are 3.00 each...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"anichols8@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1307045229,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240704.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"anichols8","Id":240704,"Name":"anichols8","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":65409,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a86b33abc3787ead5916ce190aaa84c2","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ashleyrm[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n hi, \n im looking into getting married at dreams los cabos, i would like some help figuring out how much it is going to cost me.. if anyone could help that would be great, we have about 50 guests all staying at the resort, id like to do the ultimate package that is $2999 but it says there is an additional charge for more than 20 people? and does anyone know how much that cost actually is and what do they set up for beach wedding and reception for that $2999? is it just plain chairs and plain tables? any help would be much appreciated!![\/quote] \n \n \n Hi Ashley, \n We had the ultimate package with the surf and turf with 33 guests.  We paid an extra $67 per person for 13 people since the first 20 were included.  For the setup we paid extra for the huppah on the beach ($200), the tiffany chairs ($8 pp) and sparklers ($3 pp).  (FYI these prices may have changed since last year)  Everything else we brought on our own including menus, lanterns for centerpieces, and banners.  We paid for a photographer on our own and DJ.  My review is here if it helps: [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/dreams-los-cabos-suites-golf-resort-spa-all-inclusive\/reviews\/5531\"]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/dreams-los-cabos-suites-golf-resort-spa-all-inclusive\/reviews\/5531[\/url] \n good luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1606638,"PostDate":1334201256,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ashleyrm<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> hi,<\/p> <p> im looking into getting married at dreams los cabos, i would like some help figuring out how much it is going to cost me.. if anyone could help that would be great, we have about 50 guests all staying at the resort, id like to do the ultimate package that is $2999 but it says there is an additional charge for more than 20 people? and does anyone know how much that cost actually is and what do they set up for beach wedding and reception for that $2999? is it just plain chairs and plain tables? any help would be much appreciated!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ashley,<\/p> <p> We had the ultimate package with the surf and turf with 33 guests. \u00a0We paid an extra $67 per person for 13 people since the first 20 were included. \u00a0For the setup we paid extra for the huppah on the beach ($200), the tiffany chairs ($8 pp) and sparklers ($3 pp). \u00a0(FYI these prices may have changed since last year) \u00a0Everything else we brought on our own including menus, lanterns for centerpieces, and banners. \u00a0We paid for a photographer on our own and DJ. \u00a0My review is here if it helps:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/dreams-los-cabos-suites-golf-resort-spa-all-inclusive\/reviews\/5531' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...ve\/reviews\/5531<\/a><\/p> <p> good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Dreams Los Cabos - October 29, 2011<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"janelle.hshman@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1286063473,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232862.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bride3183","Id":232862,"Name":"bride3183","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"65409","Title":"wedding dreams los cabos cost??","LastPostDate":1334201256},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
